    "The courses are copied without grades; change what differs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "科目は成績なしでコピーされます．違う部分は編集してください．"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The dates decide which term is current, the week number, and when classes stop showing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "期間によって，現在の学期，週番号，授業の表示終了が決まります．"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The end must be after the start.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "終了は開始より後にしてください．"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The last day must not be before the first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最終日は開始日より前にできません．"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The saved timetable could not be read. It was kept as a separate file and a new timetable was started.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存されていた時間割を読み込めませんでした．別のファイルとして残し，新しい時間割を始めました．"
